{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:17 2026-09-10 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:17 2026-09-10 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:17 2026-09-10 HKT</p><p>葵涌石蔭路44至66號一間酒樓於今晨（10日）10時09分發生火警，懷疑酒樓廚房煮食期間，燒味爐頭搶火燒着抽油煙機，導致冒出大量油煙，後巷煙霧彌漫。消防員趕到現場，出動一隊煙帽隊和一條喉灌救，射水降溫，至早上10時22分停止動員。事件中約50名食客自行疏散，無人受傷。</p><img alt=\"消防員射水降溫。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dafc90933c25e33ee5166c6cd9845dc7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_56_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"酒樓後巷煙霧彌漫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/12c1c5436eed378eecfd5de1ae376117/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_56.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bae613b7fd14708c6d85e5532ac57404/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_55_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"爐頭搶火燒着抽油煙機，導致冒出大量油煙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8f431caa2011427f57c4bd1179afc308/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_56_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"約50人疏散。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d2462d8f022f3a970ff3b7a08f238430/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_55_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c60b6d111996669f47a841a401c20b03/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_55.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c2ef448e4032d4a0adc861159adaa1f1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_54_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b961982d5aaae7665550675e92e1b123/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_54.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f5b5cd54ed8031bc98176ac46e067c64/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_53.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/99e7985eccc4051b631628e569375314/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_44_37.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方亦接報到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7dcddef076b29cf062beddcf9d4796fb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_57_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dc13a7e8f489b8e20d22e060c188e9ae/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_57_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f44252f0d0ef35ab94da6313a972248a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_10_42_57.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T03:33:09.962137+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}